sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Planned Asynchronous Control Loop
    accDescr: Illustrative logical concurrency on one simulation timeline. An observation is sampled at zero, inference completes at 80 ms, and the next chunk starts after the old chunk ends at 120 ms. Boundary wait is zero while observation age is 120 ms. This is a planned protocol, not a measurement.
    participant runner as ProtocolRunner
    participant world as 执行循环（Runner 驱动）
    participant model as Policy / Backend
    participant queue as ActionQueue
    participant trace as TraceSink

    Note over runner,trace: 目标逻辑，尚未实现；旧 chunk 已在执行的局部时间轴
    runner->>world: t=0：采样不可变 observation
    world-->>runner: obs_id + episode_id + sample_time
    runner-->>trace: observation_sampled
    runner->>model: submit(request_id, observation)
    runner-->>trace: inference_submitted

    par 模型推理
        model-->>trace: 实际开始时记录 inference_started
        model->>model: 预处理 → forward → 动作可消费
        model-->>runner: t=80 ms：completed(chunk)
        runner->>runner: 校验 episode；满足 release 条件
        runner->>queue: 新 chunk 可用，等待旧 chunk 交接
        runner-->>trace: completed / released
    and 世界与旧动作推进
        loop t=0 至 t=120 ms：按控制节拍
            world->>queue: 读取旧 chunk 的下一个动作
            queue-->>world: 旧动作；欠载时采用声明的 hold 策略
            world->>world: 更新控制器、动力学与观测
            world-->>trace: 动作事件 + sim tick / 采样引用
        end
    end

    Note over runner,queue: t=120 ms：旧 chunk 结束；本例无额外注入等待
    world->>queue: 请求下一个动作
    queue-->>world: 新 chunk 的首动作，来源仍为 t=0 的观测
    world-->>trace: action_started(t=120 ms, obs_id)
    Note over world,trace: boundary_wait = 0 ms；observation_age = 120 ms
    Note over runner,trace: 任意时刻 terminal：禁止新动作；在途结果隔离并 drain 后释放资源
